# No gap

**Do not use `gap`** (flexbox gap, `gap-*` utility classes, or `gap:` in CSS). Use explicit margins instead.

## Alternatives

| Instead of | Use |
|------------|-----|
| `gap-2` on flex container | `mr-2` on first/left child(ren) |
| `gap-2` between chips | `class="mr-2 mb-2"` on each chip |
| `gap-2` between buttons | `class="mr-2"` on first button |

## Examples

```vue
<!-- ✅ GOOD -->
<div class="d-flex flex-wrap">
  <v-chip class="mr-2 mb-2">A</v-chip>
  <v-chip class="mr-2 mb-2">B</v-chip>
  <v-chip class="mb-2">C</v-chip>
</div>

<div class="d-flex">
  <v-btn class="mr-2">Cancel</v-btn>
  <v-btn>Save</v-btn>
</div>

<!-- ❌ BAD -->
<div class="d-flex gap-2">
  <v-chip>A</v-chip>
  <v-chip>B</v-chip>
</div>
```
